{"parse": {"title": "交接日-06", "pageid": 123641, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-05\" title=\"交接日-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">交接日-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-07\" title=\"交接日-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">交接日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.BE.AA.E8.BF.B9.E2.80.9C.E5.80.92.E5.BD.B1.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"循迹“倒影”\">循迹“倒影”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 循迹“倒影”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Reflections She Sees</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">11:30 禁闭室</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 12.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">禁闭室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“那我想做个女骑士！就像布拉达曼特那样！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“我……我想写诗，虽然我现在写得还不好……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>孩子们畅想着未来，禁闭室中也许从未响起过像今天这般多的笑声。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>不知何时，角落的书写声也停了下来。<br />\n纪律协助教员的继任者用笔尖轻点着纸张，却迟迟没有下笔。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“那你呢，玛蒂尔达姐姐？你想做的事情是什么？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“成为一个传奇的调查员吗？以后出版很多书的那种？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“还是说像你妈妈那样，做个云游四海的水晶商人……或是了不起的占卜师？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>这个问题把玛蒂尔达难住了，她思考了一会儿才做出回答。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我对这些都有兴趣，不过……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>这些好像都不是她最想做的事。<br />\n困惑令水晶球中的画面消散，它回归了原本的模样。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_13.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 13.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Rolestory_madierda_pic_13.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Rolestory_madierda_pic_13.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Rolestory_madierda_pic_13.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>贝丽尔：</b></span>“——你的媒介是‘倒影’。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达回忆起第一次使出神秘术时母亲的话语。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>贝丽尔：</b></span>“你可以从一切能映出倒影的物品中看到关于未来的预兆。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>贝丽尔：</b></span>“一个人的神秘术，往往与她的本质有关。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>小玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“本质？这是什么意思，妈妈？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>那时候母亲笑了笑，一如既往。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>贝丽尔：</b></span>“在该知道的时候，你就会知道的。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>当时玛蒂尔达还很小，这件事最终被她遗忘在了记忆的深处。<br />\n直到此刻，水晶球光滑的弧面中映出玛蒂尔达自己的面容，她若有所悟。<br />\n最初，是爷爷讲述的那些故事。<br />\n故事中的那些主人公们历经伟大的冒险，取得傲人的成果，收获荣耀的桂冠，获得众人的仰慕。<br />\n于是玛蒂尔达的心中也埋下了一枚种子：她要成为一个伟大的人、了不起的人。<br />\n可故事里的英雄没办法为她锚定现实中的方向。怎样才称得上是个了不起的人呢？<br />\n她最初的路标是自己的母亲，贝丽尔·布翁尼。永远美丽、优雅、游刃有余。<br />\n于是玛蒂尔达也学着母亲的举手投足，拿起水晶球，磨练占卜的技艺。<br />\n校外巡礼的惊鸿一瞥，让玛蒂尔达从此将那个橙发女孩视为最大的对手。<br />\n于是她转入第一防线学校，捧起那些让来自外界的她颇有困惑的书本，在同龄人中品味着竞争、协作和伙伴的意义。<br />\n再然后是维尔汀。玛蒂尔达曾将其视为“不学无术”，却也不得不承认早在学生时代，对方就屡屡表现出令人侧目的一面。<br />\n直到“那件事”之后，“司辰”与“第一助手”渐行渐远，于是玛蒂尔达奋起直追，无数次递上升为正式调查员的申请……<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“原来……妈妈的话是那个意思。”<br />\n她终于意识到原来对于自己而言，母亲也好，十四行诗也罢，又或是维尔汀……都是一样的。<br />\n她将其中一些人视作榜样，将另一些人视作对手，但本质上，她看到的是那些她所憧憬的东西。<br />\n——于是循着眼中这些“倒影”，她一次又一次锚定自己想要前行的方向，并为之付出努力。<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 12.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<p>答案已经浮现，玛蒂尔达扬起笑容。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“——不过那些都不是我最想做的事，也不是我人生的最终目标。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我的确打算成为一名厉害的调查员，也想在占卜上更加精进。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“但在解决掉那些迫在眉睫的麻烦后，我还有很多其他感兴趣的事、想要尝试的事，很难现在就说清几十年后的自己在做什么。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>水晶球在她的手中重新焕发光彩，映出五光十色的万千世界，照亮孩子们的面庞。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“重要的是要成为自己，成为自己想要成为的、那个理想中的自己。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“所以有一件事情可以确定，那就是在那个时候——”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我一定会是一位了不起的玛蒂尔达小姐！”<br />\n</p></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "交接日-06"}}